#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Suppose you start with a particle in a spin state\n"
msgstr ""

# doq-bootstrap: dropped (table row count mismatch: source 1, translation 0): (أ) ماذا تحصل لو طبّقت مؤثر $S_z$ على متجه الحالة هذا؟ (ب) م
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"|\\psi\\rangle = \\begin{pmatrix}\\sqrt{3/5} \\\\ \\sqrt{2/5}\\end{pmatrix}.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""

# doq-bootstrap: dropped, JSX/HTML tags differ from English: <Accordion>
# <AccordionItem title="الأجوبة">
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "(a) What do you get if you act with the $S_z$ operator on this state vector? (b) What do you obtain if you make a single measurement of the $z$ component of spin of this particle? (c) What do you get if you prepare many particles identical to this state and make thousands of measurements of the $z$ component of the spin?\n"
msgstr ""

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "(a) You get\n"
msgstr "(أ) تحصل على\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"S_z |\\psi\\rangle = \\frac{\\hbar}{2} \\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{pmatrix} \\begin{pmatrix}\\sqrt{3/5} \\\\ \\sqrt{2/5}\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"= \\frac{\\hbar}{2} \\begin{pmatrix}\\sqrt{3/5} \\\\ -\\sqrt{2/5}\\end{pmatrix}.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"S_z |\\psi\\rangle = \\frac{\\hbar}{2} \\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{pmatrix} \\begin{pmatrix}\\sqrt{3/5} \\\\ \\sqrt{2/5}\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"= \\frac{\\hbar}{2} \\begin{pmatrix}\\sqrt{3/5} \\\\ -\\sqrt{2/5}\\end{pmatrix}.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "That's it. There is no experimental outcome. You just apply the matrix to the vector and you got a slightly different vector which now has a new \"-\" sign, and no longer has a magnitude of 1, since it has a prefactor $\\hbar/2$.\n"
msgstr "هذا هو. لا توجد نتيجة تجريبية. فقط تطبّق المصفوفة على المتجه وتحصل على متجه مختلف قليلاً يحتوي الآن على إشارة \"-\" جديدة، ولم تعد له قيمة حجم تساوي 1، إذ يحتوي على معامل $\\hbar/2$.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(b) You will either obtain $|\\uparrow\\rangle$ or $|\\downarrow\\rangle$. This corresponds to observing a projection of spin on the $z$ axis of either $\\hbar/2$ or $-\\hbar/2$, respectively. We can also determine the probability of each outcome, since\n"
"$$\n"
"P_{\\uparrow\\psi}=|\\langle \\uparrow|\\psi\\rangle|^2 = \\vert \\begin{pmatrix}1 & 0\\end{pmatrix} \\begin{pmatrix}\\sqrt{3/5} \\\\ \\sqrt{2/5}\\end{pmatrix}\\vert^2 = |\\sqrt{3/5}|^2 = \\frac{3}{5}\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"P_{\\downarrow\\psi}=|\\langle \\downarrow|\\psi\\rangle|^2 = \\vert \\begin{pmatrix}0 & 1\\end{pmatrix} \\begin{pmatrix}\\sqrt{3/5} \\\\ \\sqrt{2/5}\\end{pmatrix}\\vert^2 = |\\sqrt{2/5}|^2 = \\frac{2}{5}\n"
"$$\n"
"So while the spin-up state is 20% more likely, either outcome is possible, and we will only obtain one of these two states.\n"
msgstr ""
"(ب) ستحصل إما على $|\\uparrow\\rangle$ أو $|\\downarrow\\rangle$. يقابل هذا ملاحظة إسقاط السبين على المحور $z$ بمقدار $\\hbar/2$ أو $-\\hbar/2$ على التوالي. يمكننا أيضاً تحديد احتمال كل نتيجة، إذ\n"
"$$\n"
"P_{\\uparrow\\psi}=|\\langle \\uparrow|\\psi\\rangle|^2 = \\vert \\begin{pmatrix}1 & 0\\end{pmatrix} \\begin{pmatrix}\\sqrt{3/5} \\\\ \\sqrt{2/5}\\end{pmatrix}\\vert^2 = |\\sqrt{3/5}|^2 = \\frac{3}{5}\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"P_{\\downarrow\\psi}=|\\langle \\downarrow|\\psi\\rangle|^2 = \\vert \\begin{pmatrix}0 & 1\\end{pmatrix} \\begin{pmatrix}\\sqrt{3/5} \\\\ \\sqrt{2/5}\\end{pmatrix}\\vert^2 = |\\sqrt{2/5}|^2 = \\frac{2}{5}\n"
"$$\n"
"فرغم أن حالة السبين للأعلى أرجح بنسبة 20%، إلا أن كلتا النتيجتين ممكنة، وسنحصل على إحدى هاتين الحالتين فقط.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "(c) Roughly 60% of the measurements will yield spin-up particles, and roughly 40% of the measurements will yield spin-down particles, according to the measurement probabilities calculated in part (b).\n"
msgstr "(ج) ستعطي تقريباً 60% من القياسات جسيمات سبين للأعلى، وتقريباً 40% جسيمات سبين للأسفل، وفقاً لاحتمالات القياس المحسوبة في الجزء (ب).\n"

