msgid "Discussion questions: {#discussion-questions}"
msgstr "أسئلة للنقاش: {#discussion-questions}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Three friends are discussing quantum measurements and operators. Friend A says, \"Making a measurement along $z$ and acting with the operator $\\sigma_z$ are the same thing.\" Friend B says, \"Well, they are different procedures, but they have the same result.\" Friend C says, \"They are totally different; they even have different effects on most states.\" With whom do you agree and why?\n"
msgstr "ثلاثة أصدقاء يتناقشون حول القياسات والمؤثرات الكمومية. يقول الصديق أ: \"إجراء قياس على طول $z$ والتصرف بمؤثر $\\sigma_z$ هما نفس الشيء.\" يقول الصديق ب: \"حسناً، هما إجراءان مختلفان، لكن نتيجتهما واحدة.\" يقول الصديق ج: \"هما مختلفان تماماً؛ حتى تأثيرهما يختلف على معظم الحالات.\" مع من تتفق ولماذا؟\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Free response problems: {#free-response-problems}"
msgstr "مسائل الإجابة الحرة: {#free-response-problems}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Given the experimental observations and proposed syntax:\n"
msgstr "بالنظر إلى الملاحظات التجريبية والصياغة المقترحة:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$P_{\\uparrow+x}=\\vert \\begin{pmatrix}1 & 0\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}a \\\\ b\\end{pmatrix}\\vert^2 = |a|^2 =\\frac{1}{2} $$\n"
"$$P_{\\downarrow+x}=\\vert \\begin{pmatrix}0 & 1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}a \\\\ b\\end{pmatrix}\\vert^2 = |b|^2 =\\frac{1}{2} $$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$P_{\\uparrow+x}=\\vert \\begin{pmatrix}1 & 0\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}a \\\\ b\\end{pmatrix}\\vert^2 = |a|^2 =\\frac{1}{2} $$\n"
"$$P_{\\downarrow+x}=\\vert \\begin{pmatrix}0 & 1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}a \\\\ b\\end{pmatrix}\\vert^2 = |b|^2 =\\frac{1}{2} $$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "show that up to a global phase\n"
msgstr "أثبت أنه باستثناء الطور الكوني\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "$$|+\\rangle_x = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\begin{pmatrix}1 \\\\ e^{i\\alpha}\\end{pmatrix}$$\n"
msgstr "$$|+\\rangle_x = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\begin{pmatrix}1 \\\\ e^{i\\alpha}\\end{pmatrix}$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Choose $\\alpha = 0$ to obtain the standard result.\n"
msgstr "اختر $\\alpha = 0$ للحصول على النتيجة القياسية.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$P_{\\uparrow-x}=\\vert \\begin{pmatrix}1 & 0\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}a \\\\ b\\end{pmatrix}\\vert^2 = |a|^2 =\\frac{1}{2} $$\n"
"$$P_{\\downarrow-x}=\\vert \\begin{pmatrix}0 & 1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}a \\\\ b\\end{pmatrix}\\vert^2 = |b|^2 =\\frac{1}{2} $$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$P_{\\uparrow-x}=\\vert \\begin{pmatrix}1 & 0\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}a \\\\ b\\end{pmatrix}\\vert^2 = |a|^2 =\\frac{1}{2} $$\n"
"$$P_{\\downarrow-x}=\\vert \\begin{pmatrix}0 & 1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}a \\\\ b\\end{pmatrix}\\vert^2 = |b|^2 =\\frac{1}{2} $$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "And using the result from challenge problem 3:\n"
msgstr "وباستخدام النتيجة من مسألة التحدي 3:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "$$P_{+x-x}=\\vert \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\begin{pmatrix}1 & 1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}c \\\\ d\\end{pmatrix}\\vert^2 = \\frac{1}{2}|c+d|^2 =0 $$\n"
msgstr "$$P_{+x-x}=\\vert \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\begin{pmatrix}1 & 1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}c \\\\ d\\end{pmatrix}\\vert^2 = \\frac{1}{2}|c+d|^2 =0 $$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "$$|-\\rangle_x = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\begin{pmatrix}1 \\\\ -1\\end{pmatrix}$$\n"
msgstr "$$|+\\rangle_x = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\begin{pmatrix}1 \\\\ -1\\end{pmatrix}$$\n"

